 ("Visitors are asked to ------- from using mobile phones inside the recording studio.",
  ["refrain", "prevent", "avoid", "prohibit"], "동사 + 전치사: refrain from V-ing. avoid는 from 없이 V-ing, prevent·prohibit은 목적어 필요."),
 ("Customer ------- with the new mobile app has exceeded the company's expectations.",
  ["satisfaction", "satisfied", "satisfy", "satisfactory"], "명사 자리: 동사 has exceeded의 주어 → customer satisfaction(복합명사)."),
